{"page":276,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:80","surah":16,"ayah":80,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ جَعَلَ لَكُم مِّنۢ بُيُوتِكُمْ سَكَنًا وَجَعَلَ لَكُم مِّن جُلُودِ ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ بُيُوتًا تَسْتَخِفُّونَهَا يَوْمَ ظَعْنِكُمْ وَيَوْمَ إِقَامَتِكُمْ ۙ وَمِنْ أَصْوَافِهَا وَأَوْبَارِهَا وَأَشْعَارِهَآ أَثَـٰثًا وَمَتَـٰعًا إِلَىٰ حِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is God who has given you a place of rest in your homes and from the skins of animals made you homes that you find light [to handle] when you travel and when you set up camp; furnishings and comfort for a while from their wool, fur, and hair.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"(has) made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"[from]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بُيُوتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your homes","transliteration":"buyūtikum","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَكَنًۭا","en_gloss":"a resting place","transliteration":"sakanan","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَجَعَلَ","en_gloss":"and made","transliteration":"wajaʿala","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جُلُودِ","en_gloss":"the hides","transliteration":"julūdi","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"(of) the cattle","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بُيُوتًۭا","en_gloss":"tents","transliteration":"buyūtan","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَسْتَخِفُّونَهَا","en_gloss":"which you find light","transliteration":"tastakhiffūnahā","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on) the day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"16:80"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ظَ