,"en_gloss":"will be asked to make amends","transliteration":"yus'taʿtabūna","verse_key":"16:84"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٨٤","en_gloss":"(84)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:84"}]},{"verse_key":"16:85","surah":16,"ayah":85,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا رَءَا ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ فَلَا يُخَفَّفُ عَنْهُمْ وَلَا هُمْ يُنظَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When the evildoers face punishment it will not be lightened for them nor will they be given any respite.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَءَا","en_gloss":"(will) see","transliteration":"raā","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ظَلَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"wronged","transliteration":"ẓalamū","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُخَفَّفُ","en_gloss":"it will be lightened","transliteration":"yukhaffafu","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُنظَرُونَ","en_gloss":"will be given respite","transliteration":"yunẓarūna","verse_key":"16:85"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨٥","en_gloss":"(85)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:85"}]},{"verse_key":"16:86","surah":16,"ayah":86,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا رَءَا ٱلَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوا۟ شُرَكَآءَهُمْ قَالُوا۟ رَبَّنَا هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ شُرَكَآؤُنَا ٱلَّذِينَ كُنَّا نَدْعُوا۟ مِن دُونِكَ ۖ فَأَلْقَوْا۟ إِلَيْهِمُ ٱلْقَوْلَ إِنَّكُمْ لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When the idolaters see the partners they joined with God they will say, ‘Our Lord, these are the partners we used to invoke beside You,’ but the partners will retort, ‘You are liars,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَءَا","en_gloss":"(will) see","transliteration":"raā","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","en_gloss":"associated partners with Allah","transliteration":"ashrakū","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شُرَكَآءَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their partners","transliteration":"shurakāahum","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They will say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"these","transliteration":"hāulāi","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شُرَكَآؤُنَا","en_gloss":"(are) our partners","transliteration":"shurakāunā","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"we used to","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَدْعُوا۟","en_gloss":"invoke","transliteration":"nadʿū","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides You","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":14,"ar":"دُونِكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"besides You","transliteration":"dūnika","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَأَلْقَوْا۟","en_gloss":"But they (will) throw back","transliteration":"fa-alqaw","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"at them","transliteration":"ilayhimu","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلَ","en_gloss":"(their) word","transliteration":"l-qawla","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed, you","transliteration":"innakum","verse_key":"16:86"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) surely liars","trans